CORE gcc-only test-c++-front-end
not_multiple.c

^EXIT=1$
^SIGNAL=0$
error: vector size \(3\) expected to be multiple of base type size \(4\)$
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
vector_size gives a size in bytes, which must be a multiple of the base type
size; this guards the branch that neon_vector_type does not take.
